{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"cuimao-e-o063","title":"有传袁术军乱者，太祖问何夔信不，夔断其乱必矣","accounts":[{"id":"cuimao-a-b009ffdada7ddbce9a4f","label":"正文","text":"有传袁术军乱者，太祖问何夔信不，夔断其乱必矣","evidence":["cuimao-q-262234aade4b8a6b3d5f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"问者","evidence":["cuimao-q-262234aade4b8a6b3d5f"]},{"person":"wudi-p0323","role":"对断其乱必者","evidence":["cuimao-q-262234aade4b8a6b3d5f"]},{"person":"wudi-p0057","role":"被传军乱者","evidence":["cuimao-q-262234aade4b8a6b3d5f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["cuimao-q-262234aade4b8a6b3d5f"]},"ordering_evidence":"cuimao-q-262234aade4b8a6b3d5f","source_order":[12,215,12],"order":2783}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0057","name":"袁术","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0323","name":"何夔","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"cuimao-q-262234aade4b8a6b3d5f","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-8278f91af626ea7bc9be","layer":"original","quote":"时有传袁术军乱者，太祖问夔曰：“君以为信不？”夔对曰：“天之所助者顺，人之所助者信。术无信顺之实，而望天人之助，此不可以得志于天下。夫失道之主，亲戚叛之，而况于左右乎？以夔观之，其乱必矣！”太祖曰：“为国失贤则亡，君不为术所用；乱，不亦宜乎","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":12,"end":132,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
